Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(lance-graph-sink): land remapped events in a
 lance-graph route without JSON

Maps vrl::value::Value to lance_graph_vector::Event (scalars only; nested
values, missing .lg.event_id and non-UTF-8 bytes refuse the batch) and
hands the batch to VectorRoute::receive_events, the same all-or-nothing
admission as the NDJSON route. Not yet wired into a Vector sink component.

